<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Android 13+ themed icon. The system replaces the fill with its own colour pair, so this
  must be a single colour silhouette. The foreground drawable cannot simply be reused: its
  teal wedge would flatten into the white screens and the mark would become one blob.

  The three forms stay separated by real gaps, which is what keeps the silhouette readable
  once every shape is the same colour.
-->
